spring:
 cloud:
   gateway:
     routes:
       - id: urlshortening
         uri: lb://URLSHORTENING
         predicates:
           - Path=/url/**
         filters:
           - AuthenticationFilter -> When request comes with pattern url/**, tansfer the request to URLSHORTENING service but
           							before that goto AuthenticationFilter and verify token. 

       - id: identity-service
         uri: lb://IDENTITY-SERVICE
         predicates:
           - Path=/auth/**
		   
		   
From Postman		   
POST: http://localhost:8080/url/shorten?longUrl=manju
In Authorization tab, provide Auth type: JWT Bearer, secret key and token in payload in json format like
